mips: econet: enable MT SMP on the EN751221

The EN751221 is a single-core 34Kc with the MT ASE, so its two VPEs can be
brought up as SMP CPUs once SYS_SUPPORTS_MULTITHREADING is selected.

--- a/arch/mips/econet/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/econet/Kconfig
@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@
 		select SMP
 		select SMP_UP
 		select SYS_SUPPORTS_SMP
+		select SYS_SUPPORTS_MULTITHREADING
 		help
 		  The EN751221 family includes EN7512, RN7513, EN7521, EN7526.
 		  They are based on single core MIPS 34Kc processors. To boot
